  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      89.4,
      414.63,
      524.54,
      430.24
    ],
    "text": "allegations contained in the Letter of Demand (P4). As regards failure to reply to letters.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137,
      12.236929893493652
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      89.45,
      434.47,
      524.16,
      450.89
    ],
    "text": "E.R.S.R. Coomaraswamy, P.C. in his \"The Law of Evidence, 2nd Edition, 1980 Volume I,",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.238994121551514,
      11.241413116455078,
      11.636176109313965,
      11.699999809265137,
      12.236929893493652
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      89.16,
      456.16,
      292.06,
      471.77
    ],
    "text": "at page 237, has this observation to make.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.82,
      477.03,
      524.81,
      492.64
    ],
    "text": "\"Both in England and in Sri Lanka, the view has been taken in business matters,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      89.19,
      497.91,
      525.06,
      513.52
    ],
    "text": "in certain circumstances, the failure to reply to a letter amounts to an admission made",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.690596580505371,
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      89.01,
      518.44,
      493.61,
      534.19
    ],
    "text": "therein. Thus in Weideman Vs. Walpola (1891) :2 QB 534, Lord Esher, M. R. said-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.051375389099121,
      11.100000381469727,
      11.555862426757812,
      11.585186958312988,
      11.699999809265137,
      12.458277702331543
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.58,
      560.55,
      524.67,
      576.16
    ],
    "text": "\"Now, there are cases - business and mercantile cases - in which the courts have",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.52,
      581.43,
      524.86,
      597.04
    ],
    "text": "taken notice that, in the ordinary coune of business, if one man of business states",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.636176109313965,
      11.699999809265137,
      11.835317611694336,
      12.103201866149902,
      12.177169799804688,
      12.236929893493652
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.7,
      602.31,
      524.75,
      617.92
    ],
    "text": "in a letter to another that he has agreed to do certain things, the person who",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.53,
      622.91,
      524.14,
      638.71
    ],
    "text": "receives that letter must answer it if he means to dispute the fact that he did so",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.556469917297363,
      11.641755104064941,
      11.699999809265137,
      13.113470077514648,
      13.380154609680176
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.44,
      644.07,
      527.09,
      659.68
    ],
    "text": "agree. So, where merchants are in dispute one with the other in the course of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.636176109313965,
      11.699999809265137,
      12.103201866149902
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.45,
      664.48,
      524.72,
      680.09
    ],
    "text": "carrying on some business negotiation, and one writes to the other, 'but you",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      124.11,
      685.12,
      524.81,
      700.73
    ],
    "text": "promised me that you would do this or that,' if the other does not answer that",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137,
      11.996736526489258
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      517.79,
      34.96,
      526.96,
      50.08
    ],
